691	    // reintroduced. Removing them allowed the SIGTTOU regression to go
692	    // undetected. They are restored here to prevent that from happening
693	    // again.
694	    //
695	    // If you need to change prompt_yes_no's output formatting, do so
696	    // WITHOUT removing these tests. The custom yes/no prompt (y/n
697	    // shortcuts, cursor guard, styled indicators) is a legitimate
